  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Early Learning Enrichment</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this cooperative agreement is to enrich early learning in marginalized communities by using innovative curriculum models, play-based pedagogy, and multimedia assets to build foundational skills in children, enhancing knowledge, attitudes, and behaviors among children, teachers, and families by promoting positive WASH practices, which improve the learning environment.</narrative>
  </description>
